AdultToyReview exists to help you make informed decisions about adult products. We buy every product we review at full retail price — no free samples, no manufacturer influence.

## Who We Are

We're a small team of sex-positive writers, educators, and product testers. Our backgrounds span sexual health journalism, product design, and wellness coaching. We test in real homes, with real people, over extended periods.

## How We Test

Every product goes through a rigorous testing process:

- **Minimum 4-week testing period** per product
- **Multiple testers** with different bodies and preferences
- **Objective metrics**: power output, noise level, battery life, ease of cleaning, durability
- **Subjective metrics**: ease of use, sensation quality, value for money

We rate products on a 1-5 scale across categories, then aggregate into an overall score. We never allow manufacturers to preview reviews before publication.

## Our Standards

We only recommend products we'd use ourselves or suggest to close friends. If something doesn't meet our standards, we say so — even if it's a bestseller.

## Contact

Have a product suggestion? Want to pitch a guest article? Reach out at **hello@adulttoyreview.com**

